  "description": "The Haro Parkway DLX perpetuates pure freestyle vibes! With front and rear brakes and a detangler for endless trick possibilities, all built onto a 20.3\" top tube frame that is performance minded and ready for action. 25/9 micro-gearing, an adjustable railed seat that you can raise as high as you want, along with four pegs for standing, grinding, or hauling the homies.\nHi-ten frame with 20.3\" top tube\n1 1/8\" hi-ten threadless fork\n7.5\" hi-ten bars with Haro alloy top load stem\n25/9 gearing with sealed bearing 9T driver\nHaro padded fully adjustable seat\nHaro MS5 20 x 2.3\" front & rear\nAlloy 990 brake\nFour pegs, front 990 brakes and Gyro",
